+   *   - `seed`: `string` (optional) - for reproducible runs
+   *   - `correlation`: `number[][]` (optional) - correlation matrix
+   *   - `model`: `(inputs: Record<string, number>) => number` - pure fn
+   *   - `histogramBuckets`: `number` (optional, default 50)
